# Build output IS committed.
#
# PPSSPPSDL.{js,wasm,data} is ~36 MB and is what makes the site actually run.
# Regenerating it means compiling PPSSPP for wasm, which takes a long build and
# needs an Emscripten toolchain -- so excluding it would leave every clone as a
# broken front end with no emulator behind it.
#
# The 2.3 GB ppsspp-wasm/ source tree stays out of git; ./build.sh regenerates
# these three files from it.

# The emulator source tree (~2.3 GB with submodules). Only needed to rebuild.
ppsspp-wasm/

# Game images. These are yours to redistribute or not; keeping them out of git
# avoids an accidental commit of several hundred MB.
web/games/

# Local tooling
.venv/
*.log
.DS_Store